  "translation": "Mme Dawide a utwa gore Nabale o tlhokafetse, mme a re: A a segofaditswe Yahwe, yo o neng a lwela ⟨את⟩ kgetsi ya matlakabele me jaaka seatla sa Nabale, mme a sireletsa ⟨את⟩ moura wa gagwe go tswa bokgabenyane; mme ⟨את⟩ bosula jwa Nabale Yahwe o ne a bo busetsa mo tlhogong ya gagwe. Mme Dawide a romela, a bua le Abigaeele go mo tsaya go nna mosadi wa gagwe.",
